{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"3b5560fd-fc85-46d6-8f9f-bafdf75ee2b1","status":"SUCCESS","response":"A comprehensive unit test suite has been implemented in [`tests/test_accounting.py`](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-006_23844_1795166676289_baseline/tests/test_accounting.py) adhering to all specification requirements and constraints without modifying `accounting_validator.py`.\n\n### Test Coverage Highlights\n1. **Zero \u0026 Boundary Conditions**:\n   - `test_all_zeros_boundary`: Asserts `input_tokens=0, output_tokens=0, cache_read_tokens=0` returns `{\"cost_usd\": 0.0, ...}` with exact expected integer/float types and keys.\n2. **Standard \u0026 Corner Calculations**:\n   - `test_standard_calculation_with_cache`: Tests partial cache hits and accurate rate calculation across input, output, and cache rates.\n   - `test_full_cache_hit`: Tests behavior when `cache_read_tokens == input_tokens` (`billable_uncached_input == 0`).\n   - `test_zero_cache_hit`: Tests behavior when `cache_read_tokens == 0` (`billable_uncached_input == input_tokens`).\n   - `test_output_only`: Tests tokens strictly on output when input and cache are 0.\n   - `test_rounding_to_six_decimal_places`: Validates 6-decimal-place rounding contract (`round(cost, 6)`).\n   - `test_return_dictionary_keys_and_contract`: Verifies exact presence of `\"cost_usd\"`, `\"billable_uncached_input\"`, `\"cache_tokens\"`, and `\"output_tokens\"`.\n3. **Cache Validation**:\n   - `test_cache_read_exceeds_input_tokens`: Validates `ValueError` when `cache_read_tokens \u003e input_tokens`.\n   - `test_cache_read_exceeds_zero_input_tokens`: Validates `ValueError` when cache read is attempted on 0 inputs.\n4. **Input Type \u0026 Boundary Validation**:\n   - Parametrized tests covering negatives, floats, booleans (which inherit from int in Python), strings, None, and collections for `input_tokens`, `output_tokens`, and `cache_read_tokens`.\n5. **Rate Card Contracts**:\n   - Parametrized tests verifying `KeyError` when `\"input_per_million\"`, `\"output_per_million\"`, or `\"cache_per_million\"` is missing, empty rate card checks, and handling extra metadata keys safely.\n\nAll 40 test cases execute hermetically and pass with `pytest`.\n","duration_seconds":53.2171051,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":46969,"output_tokens":4001,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":214200,"total_tokens":50970}}}
